        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Morgan Llywelyn, Robert Jordan, James Oliver Rigney Jr., Brian Boru\n- Works: Lion of Ireland, The Wheel of Time\n- Concepts: One Power\n- Topics: historical fantasy, historical fiction, historical non-fiction, epic fantasy, magic\n\nFacts:\n- Morgan Llywelyn was born on December 3, 1937 and is an American-Irish writer of historical fantasy, historical fiction, and historical non-fiction.\n- James Oliver Rigney Jr. was born on October 17, 1948, wrote under the pen name Robert Jordan, and was an American author of epic fantasy.\n- Lion of Ireland is a novel by Morgan Llywelyn about the life of the Irish hero and High King Brian Boru.\n- In Robert Jordan's The Wheel of Time fantasy series, the One Power is a supernatural force that some characters can harness to perform feats of magic.\n- Robert Jordan died on September 16, 2007.",
